  "description": "<img style=\"display:block;margin:auto;border:0 solid transparent;width:100%;max-width:420px;height:auto\" src=\"modules/bane-of-azeroth/assets/adventure/logo.webp\" alt=\"Bane of Azeroth\"><p>This will import all Bane of Azeroth content included in this version of the module into your world.</p><p>Bane of Azeroth is a player options supplement for Dragonbane. It adds Warcraft-inspired kin, heroic abilities, equipment, spells, and companions while continuing to use the Dragonbane core rules. The supplement is purely additive and does not replace the core rules.</p><p><strong>Note:</strong> Existing imported versions of the content with matching IDs will be overwritten.</p><p>To keep ownership settings on existing content when re-importing, enable <strong>Keep ownership on import</strong> setting under <strong>Game Settings &gt; Configure Settings</strong>.</p><hr><p style=\"font-size:smaller\">This is a Dragonbane conversion of <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1BSit21xGH7yRdWRO95lvrsbxvYi5IwlY\"><em>Champions of Azeroth</em></a> by <a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/user/Silverblade1234/\">Silverblade</a>. A lot of the body text in this project was written by Silverblade and is republished with permission.</p><p style=\"font-size:smaller\">This game supplement was created under Fria Ligan AB's <a href=\"https://freeleaguepublishing.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/Dragonbane-License-Agreement.pdf\">Dragonbane Third Party Supplement License</a>. It is neither affiliated with, sponsored by, nor endorsed by Fria Ligan AB or Blizzard Entertainment, Inc.</p><p>Foundry VTT module by: Auvreannia</p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/Frogvall/bane-of-azeroth\">Project repository</a></p>",
